; CLOCK KEYWORDS
; Clock keywords (the sub-CPU RTC through timer IOCS 02H SWRT / 03H SRRT, alarm 1
; 06H, alarm 2 08H/09H; fields parsed / formatted as two-digit BCD at FA12H...).
;   TIME        function: MMDDHH.mmss as a number (4DF5H)
;   TIME = n    statement (4DCFH)
;   DATE$       function "mm/dd" (4E43H);  DATE$ = "mm/dd" (4E05H)
;   TIME$       function "hh:mm:ss" (4ECBH); TIME$ = "hh:mm:ss" (4E7CH);
;               TIME$ ON|OFF|STOP; ON TIME$ ... GOSUB (alarm 1)
;   ALARM$      function "mm/dd/hh/mm" (4F96H, empty if not set);
;   ALARM$ = "..." / "" set / clear alarm 2 (4F11H; also the alarm signal
;               condition IOCS 22H/23H and the SWMSK bit 5)
; Error 7C1EH: bad date/time text, 7C0AH: string buffer full.
